    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在整个（小）宇宙讨论不超过5期的《亚特兰大》，实乃沧海遗珠，鉴于剧已完结，未来可能也不会有更火爆的局面，本人义不容辞当起推广大使，虽然说得又严肃了，但是希望更多人能接收到我的脑电波~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">15:7</a> &nbsp;get to know Donald Glover 始末</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">6:39</a> 剧情梗概</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> Glover是一个野心勃勃和生机勃勃的表达者，一切形式都为表达服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> “我们”的声音被夺走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 关于pure henessy=chris evans 的绝妙段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> “我们”能掌握的资源有限，“我们”是一种境遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> “我们”如何有策略地为自己发声？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> “我们”希望以何种方式清算历史？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">52:57</a> 由一个情节看全剧的悲伤底色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3382">56:22</a> 楠楠子很喜欢的一个段落的一首小歌，邀大家共赏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQ5cOHwN_AujRGJSS2JIvOXfKcU.png"></figure>]]></description>
